  "details": "I just found proof that vrchat doesn't really care for it's gamers who have no other choice but to use vms, at the time of writing this I am able to play the game rematch and outlast trails which both utilise EAC, vrchat devs stop lying to us saying that you have no way to make vrchat playable again on vms, there is a partial deal already in place between epic games and shadow pc for the devs to request the whitelisting of shadow pc, the devs are purposely not doing this as they admit themselves they don't support the use of vms, if we lived in a perfect world where people didn't need to splash close to 2000 for a functional gaming pc and vms didn't exist because people were able to get a gaming pc great but we don't live in a perfect world and like with everything in this world not everything is black and white, good or evil people who use vms are not all ban evaders, cheaters, hackers whatnot.\n\nRematch and outlast trials work on shadow pc they both use EAC so kindly explain how they work without error and vrchat, dead by daylight and a bunch of other games don't.",
